Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 14:53:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Log the relay endpoints, their is_fna flags and the relay's
 STUN answers

A call that never receives the peer's media (inbound calls on the WinZapp
build: frames from the other side stay at 0) shows nothing about why. Log
the endpoint list with the chosen one marked (names and flags only), the
first STUN packets the relay sends, and whether relay data that arrives
after media started would have picked another endpoint.
